  "summary": "Live replacement removes memberships/access, role/function assignments, owned authority and channel endpoints; cancels unfinished paid work while preserving completed artifacts/admitted sender snapshots. New actors execute real work from explicit profiles/current access. Three Sarah functions separated; ADR-007 finalized. Seven traces/16 paired seeds and 45 focused tests pass; optional historical regression failures retained.",
  "reviewer": "Worker self-review followed by root operator independent engineering review",
  "review_notes": "Reviewed AE-015 before editing: entry hash check and actual protocol/source/results/operator disposition and runtime bug probe pass within stated toy limits. Forty-five focused tests cover live cancellation/new work, redundant holders/functions, explicit surviving delegation, retired bridges, incoming/outgoing in-flight messages, prepared matched-profile continuity, noncritical/renamed/kind controls, rejected commands and equal-time/multiple-job boundaries. Seven trace controls and sixteen paired seeds reproduce; nine lossy seeds retained. Normal delivery does not initialize unused channels. Optional full suite retains 485 passes and two historical failures without rewriting out-of-scope tests or predecessor evidence; all other JSON-normalized AE-013 trace fields remain identical. Entry changed inputs archived at original hashes. Pass is engineering scope only; no all-suite green, calibrated organization/payment, player acceptance, independent architecture acceptance, integration/publication or campaign completion. Required local delivery is reported separately. Single permitted local staging attempt failed with exit 128 on shared Git metadata read-only index.lock; no local commit delivered. No retry/push/integration; worker status failed for required delivery despite completed source/engineering evidence. Root preserved the original failures/receipt/tests, then explicitly migrated two compatibility regressions under the owner-directed window revision: 115 focused tests pass. Production source and replacement traces unchanged. Planning-only input hashes are pinned to the reviewed integration target and will be checked in its assembled candidate; no current-source checkout checker pass is claimed after that rebinding. The exact assembled target passed 487 total tests, seven/16 canonical replacement replay, current receipt hashes and diff check. Frozen AE-013 records unchanged. The original two worker regression failures are historical and have been reconciled explicitly.",
